#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. こんな物を気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. Now's\n"
"no time to think about it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もし、何かあったなら…
#. このカメラでそれも見ていたはずだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If something did happen...one of these cameras must\n"
"have caught it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ドアが開くぞ？
#. ロックが掛かってるはずじゃなかったっけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door's open. But aren't these supposed to be\n"
"locked...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちは女子更衣室のドアだ。
#. ボクじゃロックを外せないから入れない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door to the girls locker room. I have no way of\n"
"unlocking it, so I couldn't go in if I wanted to.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 更衣室のロックを解除するには…
#. 電子生徒手帳が必要なんだったよな。
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You need an e-Handbook to unlock the locker rooms..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは電子生徒手帳を取り出し、
#. それをカードリーダーに重ねた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I took out my handbook and swiped it across the card\n"
"reader.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あ…れ？
#. なんの反応も…ない。
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? It...didn't do anything."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こっちは女子更衣室のカードリーダーだ。
#. ボクの電子生徒手帳じゃ反応しないはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The girls locker room card reader. I'm listed as\n"
"\"male\" in my e-Handbook, so it can't open this door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…本物の銃だよな？
#. なんでこんな物があるんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that...a real gun? Why is there something like that\n"
"here...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>水泳用の色々な用具がある…
#. なんに使うのかよくわからないものもある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some swimming gear, and a bunch of other stuff\n"
"that I dunno what it's for.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>浮き輪がある…
#. ボクは泳げるから必要ないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A flotation donut... I know how to swim, so I don't\n"
"think I'll need something like that.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう少し…ここを調べてみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should probably look around a little more...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 現在は<CLT 3>“捜査”<CLT>の為に、ロックを解除してあります。
#. どうぞ、ご自由にお調べください。
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"For this <CLT 3>investigation<CLT>, I have unlocked the doors.\n"
"Please look around to your heart's content!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、捜査って…！？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-Investigation...?"
msgstr ""

#. やはりな…
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Just as I thought."
msgstr ""

#. 十神クン…ッ！
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Byakuya—!"
msgstr ""

#. 今のモノクマの口調からして…
#. やはり<CLT 3>“殺人”<CLT>が起きたのは間違いないようだ。
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Judging from what he just said, there can be no doubt\n"
"a <CLT 3>murder<CLT> really has taken place."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんなッ…！！
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "C-Come on...!"
msgstr ""

#. それと、あっちの更衣室…
msgctxt "0024 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And the locker rooms..."
msgstr ""

#. 怪しいな…とても怪しい…
#. お前もそう思わないか？
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"They're suspicious. Very suspicious, indeed. Wouldn't\n"
"you agree?"
msgstr ""

#. え？　怪しいって…？
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Suspicious...?"
msgstr ""

#. 更衣室はまだ誰も見てないようだな。
#. では、まずは先に<CLT 3>女子更衣室<CLT>から見てみるか…
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It seems nobody's searched the locker rooms. Let's\n"
"start with the <CLT 3>girls locker room<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンは独り言のように、
#. そう呟き…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He was muttering, as if talking only to himself.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、ボクの返事も待たずに、
#. 女子更衣室のドアに手をかけた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without waiting for a reply, he pressed his hand\n"
"against the girls locker room door...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ドアは音もなくゆっくりと開き…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...and the door swung open without a sound.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこで…時が止まった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In that moment, time seemed to freeze.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. え………………？
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その光景を、現実のものとして認識するまで、
#. しばらくの時間が必要だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't know how long it took for me to fully\n"
"comprehend the reality of what I was looking at.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、その認識が行われた後…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But as soon as I did...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うわぁぁあああああああああああああッ！！
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "UwaaaaaaAAAAAAHHH!!!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの口からは、
#. 自然と叫び声が溢れ出していた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A wild, almost primeval scream escaped from my mouth.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
